2026-07-27T09:17:54.7080247Z i /tmp/RtmpT96wVX/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:17:54.7080671Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:17:54.7081138Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:17:54.7081515Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:17:54.7082090Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:17:54.7083073Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:17:54.7084145Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
